    },
    {
      "id": 237,
      "start": 571.12,
      "end": 572.18,
      "en": "It's perfectly safe.",
      "zh": "绝对安全。"
    },
    {
      "id": 238,
      "start": 572.68,
      "end": 573.28,
      "en": "There isn't anyone.",
      "zh": "一个人也没有。"
    },
    {
      "id": 239,
      "start": 576.64,
      "end": 582.92,
      "en": "We're going to look at two phrases now in Fluency Builder that you might hear when you're talking about a crime.",
      "zh": "我们将在流利表达环节看看你在谈论犯罪时可能会听到的两个短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 240,
      "start": 584.12,
      "end": 585.02,
      "en": "Fluency Builder.",
      "zh": "流利表达。"
    },
    {
      "id": 241,
      "start": 585.74,
      "end": 589.52,
      "en": "So the first phrase that we're going to look at is, what the heck is going on?",
      "zh": "所以我们要看的第一个短语是，到底发生了什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 242,
      "start": 589.78,
      "end": 590.9,
      "en": "What the heck is going on?",
      "zh": "到底发生什么事了？"
    },
    {
      "id": 243,
      "start": 591.24,
      "end": 593.32,
      "en": "What the heck is going on?",
      "zh": "到底发生什么事了？"
    },
    {
      "id": 244,
      "start": 593.96,
      "end": 594.4,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 245,
      "start": 594.4,
      "end": 597.2,
      "en": "So this is just asking what's happening, right?",
      "zh": "所以这只是在问发生了什么，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 246,
      "start": 597.36,
      "end": 598.36,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 247,
      "start": 598.36,
      "end": 600.64,
      "en": "So this is a very strong way of saying what's happening.",
      "zh": "所以这是一种语气很强的说法，用来表达正在发生什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 248,
      "start": 600.64,
      "end": 601.64,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 249,
      "start": 601.64,
      "end": 602.12,
      "en": "What really is happening?",
      "zh": "真正发生了什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 250,
      "start": 602.64,
      "end": 603.64,
      "en": "Uh-huh.",
      "zh": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "id": 251,
      "start": 603.64,
      "end": 604.78,
      "en": "Now, why do they say, what the heck?",
      "zh": "现在，他们为什么说，到底是什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 252,
      "start": 605.48,
      "end": 605.76,
      "en": "What is heck?",
      "zh": "heck 是什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "id": 253,
      "start": 606.48,
      "end": 608.98,
      "en": "Well, heck is sort of a polite way of saying hell.",
      "zh": "嗯，heck 是 hell（地狱）比较礼貌的说法。"
    },
    {
      "id": 254,
      "start": 609.26,
      "end": 609.54,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 255,
      "start": 609.54,
      "end": 611.68,
      "en": "So instead of saying, what the hell is going on?",
      "zh": "所以不说 what the hell is going on（到底怎么回事）？"
    },
    {
      "id": 256,
      "start": 611.84,
      "end": 612.86,
      "en": "What the heck is going on?",
      "zh": "到底发生什么事了？"
    },
    {
      "id": 257,
      "start": 613.0,
      "end": 614.64,
      "en": "Now, why do you do this?",
      "zh": "现在，你为什么要这样做？"
    },
    {
      "id": 258,
      "start": 614.64,
      "end": 620.0,
      "en": "Because especially in American English, we don't like to talk about religious words.",
      "zh": "因为尤其是美式英语，我们不喜欢谈论宗教词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 259,
      "start": 620.36,
      "end": 626.08,
      "en": "So like hell and God and Jesus, these things are impolite in American English.",
      "zh": "所以就像地狱、上帝和耶稣一样，这些东西在美国英语中是不礼貌的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 260,
      "start": 626.08,
      "end": 627.08,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 261,
      "start": 627.08,
      "end": 628.08,
      "en": "You don't want to offend anyone.",
      "zh": "你不想冒犯任何人。"
    },
    {
      "id": 262,
      "start": 628.08,
      "end": 630.96,
      "en": "That's why we would have other words like, oh my gosh.",
      "zh": "这就是为什么我们会有其他词，比如，天哪。"
    },
    {
      "id": 263,
      "start": 631.52,
      "end": 632.04,
      "en": "For oh my God.",
      "zh": "哦，我的上帝。"
    },
    {
      "id": 264,
      "start": 632.8,
      "end": 633.96,
      "en": "Or geez.",
      "zh": "或天哪。"
    },
    {
      "id": 265,
      "start": 634.4,
      "end": 634.76,
      "en": "Instead of Jesus.",
      "zh": "而不是耶稣。"
    },
    {
      "id": 266,
      "start": 635.4,
      "end": 635.56,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 267,
      "start": 635.98,
      "end": 636.12,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 268,
      "start": 637.4,
      "end": 642.12,
      "en": "So that is an interesting thing and of course, it is a little bit of a sensitive topic among some people.",
      "zh": "所以这是一件有趣的事情，当然，它在某些人中有点敏感。"
    },
    {
      "id": 269,
      "start": 642.12,
      "end": 645.2,
      "en": "So that's why it's better to just use these synonyms.",
      "zh": "所以这就是为什么最好只使用这些同义词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 270,
      "start": 645.52,
      "end": 645.68,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 271,
      "start": 646.12,
      "end": 646.42,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 272,
      "start": 647.4,
      "end": 648.42,
      "en": "And what about our next phrase?",
      "zh": "那么我们的下一个短语呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 273,
      "start": 648.88,
      "end": 651.66,
      "en": "So they suspected her of being a kidnapper.",
      "zh": "所以他们怀疑她是绑架者。"
    },
    {
      "id": 274,
      "start": 651.88,
      "end": 652.16,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 275,
      "start": 653.28,
      "end": 656.48,
      "en": "So suspected her of being a kidnapper.",
      "zh": "所以怀疑她是绑架者。"
    },
    {
      "id": 276,
      "start": 656.48,
      "end": 657.48,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 277,
      "start": 657.48,
      "end": 660.96,
      "en": "So I suspect someone of being something.",
      "zh": "所以我怀疑某人是某物。"
    },
    {
      "id": 278,
      "start": 660.96,
      "end": 664.48,
      "en": "So I suspect she is an alien.",
      "zh": "所以我怀疑她是外星人。"
    },
    {
      "id": 279,
      "start": 665.02,
      "end": 665.24,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 280,
      "start": 665.96,
      "end": 667.34,
      "en": "I suspect him of being a liar.",
      "zh": "我怀疑他是个骗子。"
    },
    {
      "id": 281,
      "start": 667.84,
      "end": 668.14,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 282,
      "start": 668.4,
      "end": 669.58,
      "en": "So what about to suspect?",
      "zh": "那么该怎么怀疑呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 283,
      "start": 669.92,
      "end": 670.72,
      "en": "What does that mean exactly?",
      "zh": "这到底是什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "id": 284,
      "start": 671.18,
      "end": 674.76,
      "en": "To think something that is true, but not be 100% sure.",
      "zh": "就是认为某件事是真的，但并不百分之百确定。"
    },
    {
      "id": 285,
      "start": 674.98,
      "end": 678.4,
      "en": "So you can say, I think she is a kidnapper.",
      "zh": "所以你可以说，我认为她是一个绑架者。"
    },
    {
      "id": 286,
      "start": 678.68,
      "end": 679.68,
      "en": "Yep.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 287,
      "start": 679.68,
      "end": 681.92,
      "en": "Oh, I suspect her of being a kidnapper.",
      "zh": "哦，我怀疑她是绑架者。"
    },
    {
      "id": 288,
      "start": 682.0,
      "end": 682.4,
      "en": "Interesting.",
      "zh": "有意思。"
    },
    {
      "id": 289,
      "start": 683.32,
      "end": 684.32,
      "en": "Why don't we hear a few more examples?",
      "zh": "我们再多听几个例子吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 290,
      "start": 687.56,
      "end": 690.44,
      "en": "Example one.",
      "zh": "例句一。"
    },
    {
      "id": 291,
      "start": 690.44,
      "end": 692.84,
      "en": "The police suspected him of being a bank robber.",
      "zh": "警方怀疑他是银行劫匪。"
    },
    {
      "id": 292,
      "start": 696.32,
      "end": 696.58,
      "en": "Example two.",
      "zh": "例句二。"
    },
    {
      "id": 293,
      "start": 699.8,
      "end": 702.16,
      "en": "We suspect our dog is responsible for this mess.",
      "zh": "我们怀疑我们的狗要为这个混乱负责。"
    },
    {
      "id": 294,
      "start": 706.56,
      "end": 706.96,
      "en": "Example three.",
      "zh": "例句三。"
    },
    {
      "id": 295,
      "start": 709.76,
      "end": 712.65,
      "en": "The neighborhood suspected that our neighbor was selling drugs.",
      "zh": "邻居怀疑我们的邻居在卖毒品。"
    },
    {
      "id": 296,
      "start": 716.02,
      "end": 716.38,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 297,
      "start": 716.72,
      "end": 716.9,
      "en": "Very good.",
      "zh": "很好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 298,
      "start": 717.72,
      "end": 718.42,
      "en": "So we've seen a lot of vocab.",
      "zh": "所以我们看到了很多词汇。"
    },
    {
      "id": 299,
      "start": 718.72,
      "end": 719.48,
      "en": "We've seen these phrases.",
      "zh": "我们见过这些短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 300,
      "start": 720.2,
      "end": 725.24,
      "en": "So I think it's time for us to listen to our dialogue for the last time, and then we'll come back and talk a little bit more.",
      "zh": "所以我认为是时候让我们最后一次听我们的对话了，然后我们会回来多说一点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 301,
      "start": 725.92,
      "end": 731.36,
      "en": "What the heck is going on?",
      "zh": "到底发生什么事了？"
    },
    {
      "id": 302,
      "start": 734.65,
      "end": 735.25,
      "en": "Did you see that?",
      "zh": "你看到了吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 303,
      "start": 735.53,
      "end": 736.23,
      "en": "What was that thing?",
      "zh": "刚才那东西是什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 304,
      "start": 736.61,
      "end": 737.01,
      "en": "I don't know.",
      "zh": "我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "id": 305,
      "start": 737.6,
      "end": 738.37,
      "en": "I'm just glad we made it out.",
      "zh": "幸好我们逃出来了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 306,
      "start": 739.88,
      "end": 740.96,
      "en": "Look, there's a police car.",
      "zh": "看，有一辆警车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 307,
      "start": 743.72,
      "end": 744.72,
      "en": "Help!",
      "zh": "救命！"
    },
    {
      "id": 308,
      "start": 744.72,
      "end": 745.72,
      "en": "Help!",
      "zh": "救命！"
    },
    {
      "id": 309,
      "start": 745.72,
      "end": 747.76,
      "en": "Please, please stop!",
      "zh": "请停下来！"
    },
    {
      "id": 310,
      "start": 747.76,
      "end": 752.08,
      "en": "Howdy, ma'am.",
      "zh": "您好，女士。"
    },
    {
      "id": 311,
      "start": 753.29,
      "end": 755.01,
      "en": "What, uh, seems to be the problem?",
      "zh": "呃，有什么问题吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 312,
      "start": 755.88,
      "end": 756.97,
      "en": "Is this man bothering you?",
      "zh": "这个人在打扰你吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 313,
      "start": 757.6,
      "end": 759.08,
      "en": "Officer, officer.",
      "zh": "警官，警官！"
    },
    {
      "id": 314,
      "start": 759.08,
      "end": 761.25,
      "en": "There is, like, a witch creature back there.",
      "zh": "后面有个像女巫一样的怪物。"
    },
    {
      "id": 315,
      "start": 761.64,
      "end": 764.57,
      "en": "We tied her up, but she broke free, and she was about to have us for dinner.",
      "zh": "我们把她绑起来，但她挣脱了，她差点把我们当晚餐吃掉。"
    },
    {
      "id": 316,
      "start": 765.51,
      "end": 767.83,
      "en": "Okay, calm down, calm down.",
      "zh": "好吧，冷静下来，冷静下来。"
    },
    {
      "id": 317,
      "start": 768.49,
      "end": 770.21,
      "en": "Let me see your eyes, please.",
      "zh": "请让我看看您的眼睛。"
    },
    {
      "id": 318,
      "start": 770.79,
      "end": 772.53,
      "en": "Have you been drinking tonight, son?",
      "zh": "你今晚喝酒了吗，儿子？"
    },
    {
      "id": 319,
      "start": 773.22,
      "end": 774.28,
      "en": "We're telling the truth.",
      "zh": "我们在说真话。"
    },
    {
      "id": 320,
      "start": 775.26,
      "end": 776.22,
      "en": "She's in there.",
      "zh": "她就在里面。"
    },
    {
      "id": 321,
      "start": 776.68,
      "end": 782.9,
      "en": "We suspected her being a kidnapper or a rapist, but turns out she's an alien or something.",
      "zh": "我们怀疑她是绑架者或强奸犯，但事实证明她是外星人或什么的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 322,
      "start": 784.04,
      "end": 786.32,
      "en": "Okay, calm down, calm down.",
      "zh": "好吧，冷静下来，冷静下来。"
    },
    {
      "id": 323,
      "start": 787.08,
      "end": 788.36,
      "en": "Let me see your eyes, please.",
      "zh": "请让我看看您的眼睛。"
    },
    {
      "id": 324,
      "start": 788.76,
      "end": 789.76,
      "en": "Ugh, seriously.",
      "zh": "呃，说真的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 325,
      "start": 790.7,
      "end": 792.02,
      "en": "Are you going to help us out or not?",
      "zh": "你到底帮不帮我们？"
    },
    {
      "id": 326,
      "start": 792.8,
      "end": 793.36,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 327,
      "start": 793.8,
      "end": 795.58,
      "en": "Let's go have a look, shall we?",
      "zh": "我们去看看，好吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 328,
      "start": 804.08,
      "end": 810.68,
      "en": "Hello?",
      "zh": "喂？"
    },
    {
      "id": 329,
      "start": 810.68,
      "end": 824.04,
      "en": "Is anyone in there?",
      "zh": "有人在里面吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 330,
      "start": 825.58,
      "end": 826.22,
      "en": "Be careful!",
      "zh": "小心!"
    },
    {
      "id": 331,
      "start": 826.66,
      "end": 827.54,
      "en": "She might be hiding!",
      "zh": "她可能会躲起来！"
    },
    {
      "id": 332,
      "start": 837.38,
      "end": 838.94,
      "en": "It's perfectly safe.",
      "zh": "绝对安全。"
    },
    {
      "id": 333,
      "start": 839.26,
      "end": 839.88,
      "en": "There isn't anyone.",
      "zh": "一个人也没有。"
    },
    {
      "id": 334,
      "start": 840.36,
      "end": 861.2,
      "en": "You're mil Taking too long.",
      "zh": "你花费的时间太长了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 335,
      "start": 870.65,
      "end": 874.69,
      "en": "Okay, well, Marco, we're coming near the end of this series, aren't we?",
      "zh": "好吧，Marco，我们即将结束这个系列，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 336,
      "start": 874.97,
      "end": 875.43,
      "en": "Yes, exactly.",
      "zh": "对，没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 337,
      "start": 875.91,
      "end": 880.73,
      "en": "It's a short series, but what do you think happens or how do you think the series ends?",
      "zh": "这是一个短系列，但您认为会发生什么或您认为该系列如何结束？"
    },
    {
      "id": 338,
      "start": 880.97,
      "end": 882.55,
      "en": "What is really going on?",
      "zh": "到底发生了什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 339,
      "start": 883.12,
      "end": 884.67,
      "en": "A mystery here at EnglishPod.",
      "zh": "Englishpod 的一个谜。"
    },
    {
      "id": 340,
      "start": 885.14,
      "end": 886.33,
      "en": "So we want to hear from you.",
      "zh": "所以我们想听听你的意见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 341,
      "start": 886.57,
      "end": 887.57,
      "en": "What do you think is going to happen?",
      "zh": "你认为会发生什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 342,
      "start": 887.83,
      "end": 888.05,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 343,
      "start": 889.04,
      "end": 898.68,
      "en": "You can find it at EnglishPod.com where you can leave us your questions, your comments, or even maybe your ideas, not only for this lesson, but for any lesson that you would like to hear.",
      "zh": "您可以在 Englishpod.com 上找到它，您可以在其中给我们留下您的问题、您的评论，甚至可能是您的想法，不仅是为了本课，而且是您想听的任何课程。"
    },
    {
      "id": 344,
      "start": 898.68,
      "end": 899.02,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 345,
      "start": 899.32,
      "end": 903.06,
      "en": "Well, guys, we're happy that you downloaded this lesson and remember to check out our website.",
      "zh": "好吧，伙计们，我们很高兴您下载了本课并记得查看我们的网站。"
    },
    {
      "id": 346,
      "start": 903.84,
      "end": 906.96,
      "en": "Until next time, thanks for listening and goodbye.",
      "zh": "直到下一次，感谢您的收听和再见。"
    }
  ],
